==English==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|en|enm|singulerly}}; equivalent to {{suffix|en|singular|ly}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|GA}} {{IPA|en|/ˈsɪŋɡjəlɚli/}}
* {{a|RP}} {{IPA|en|/ˈsɪŋɡjʊləli/}}
* {{audio|en|En-us-singularly.ogg|Audio (US)}}
